          "text": "Description: On January 8, 1977, at 20:50, a witness observed a bright light coming from an object they could not see. No noise was heard during the short observation. The object disappeared on a descending trajectory behind the houses in the direction of the forest. No trace or other testimony was able to provide additional information about the phenomenon.",
